  friendName: Pecker
  friendDescription: 'This is Pecker the woodpecker, and he loves to peck wood! In
    fact, he is so good at pecking trees, he is a professional lumber jack. He is
    overly protective of his friends who see him as an older brother!

    His skills
    as a professional lumberjack help remove fallen trees and logs that stand in
    the way of Glorp and Friends!

'
